sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Publisher
    participant R as Redis
    participant A as Subscriber A (online)
    participant B as Subscriber B (offline)
    A->>R: SUBSCRIBE news
    P->>R: PUBLISH news "m1"
    R-->>P: 1 (receivers)
    R->>A: m1
    Note over B: B is disconnected
    P->>R: PUBLISH news "m2"
    R-->>P: 1 (receivers)
    R->>A: m2
    B->>R: SUBSCRIBE news
    Note over B,R: B never gets m1 or m2. Redis kept nothing.
